                    "onClickContentItem": "",
                    "html": "<div class=\"learningPath\">\n    <p class=\"lpIntro\">Six questions, each right after the part of the video that answers it. A wrong answer plays that part again.</p>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\"><span class=\"lpTime\">0:00</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">The Sun, our star</span><span class=\"lpDots\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"16\" data-end=\"50\"><span class=\"lpTime\">0:16</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">How gravity formed the Sun</span><span class=\"lpDots\"><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"What happens to an object’s pull on other objects as it gains mass?\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"75.5\"><span class=\"lpTime\">0:50</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">Forces and orbits</span><span class=\"lpDots\"><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"The Moon moves around the Earth. What is this movement called?\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"75.5\" data-end=\"96.5\"><span class=\"lpTime\">1:15</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">Eight planets</span><span class=\"lpDots\"><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"Which of these are inner planets? Select all that apply.\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"96.5\" data-end=\"121.5\"><span class=\"lpTime\">1:36</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">The Sun’s energy</span><span class=\"lpDots\"><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"What can the solar wind cause in the sky near the Earth’s poles?\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"121.5\" data-end=\"159\"><span class=\"lpTime\">2:01</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">Distances in space</span><span class=\"lpDots\"><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"What is one astronomical unit (AU)?\"></span><span class=\"lpDot\" data-question=\"How far does the Solar System reach?\"></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"timebased lpRow\" data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"179.203\"><span class=\"lpTime\">2:39</span><span class=\"lpTitle\">The unexplored edge</span><span class=\"lpDots\"></span></div>\n    <p class=\"lpScore\"><span class=\"lpScoreValue\">0 of 6</span> right on the first try</p>\n    <p class=\"lpLegend\"><span class=\"lpDot right\"></span> first try <span class=\"lpDot retried\"></span> after a replay <span class=\"lpDot wrong\"></span> not yet</p>\n    <p class=\"lpCredit\">Video: <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Solar_System_explained_by_simpleshow_foundation.webm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solar System explained</a> by Cornel Becheru, simpleshow foundation, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a></p>\n</div>",
